Package: mapycusmaximus
Title: Applies Focus–Glue–Context Fisheye Transformations for Spatial Visualization
Version: 0.0.0.1092
Authors@R: 
    person("Alex", "Nguyen", , "thanhcuong10091992@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The mapycusmaximus package provides tools for applying fisheye transformations to 2D coordinates and spatial vector geometries. It implements the **Focus–Glue–Context (FGC)** model: a smooth radial distortion that enlarges a focal region, transitions through a glue ring, and preserves outside context.
